      "value": "<p>The berserker's senses allow him to sense danger and become enraged before he even has time to consciously react to danger. When combat begins, if the berserker has rounds of rage remaining, he may automatically enter a rage without using an action at the start of the first round of combat (or at the start of the surprise round, if there is one), even if he is not otherwise aware that combat has begun.</p>",
